WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:49.362
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:49.632 --> 00:51.301
Viktor! Viktor!

3
00:54.429 --> 00:58.224
Cute, but we still have a long way to go.

4
00:58.308 --> 00:59.726
But where are we going?

5
01:08.276 --> 01:10.445
Forget all those emotions.

6
01:10.528 --> 01:11.404
It's all nonsense!

7
01:11.488 --> 01:13.323
Whatever kindness they've shown you,

8
01:13.406 --> 01:16.159
whatever kindness Mikoy and Chiara have shown you,

9
01:16.242 --> 01:17.494
forget all of it.

10
01:17.577 --> 01:19.079
What matters most of all

11
01:19.162 --> 01:21.539
is the plan we're all working on.

12
01:21.623 --> 01:23.708
Forget those emotions.

13
01:24.334 --> 01:25.877
They don't matter!

14
01:29.130 --> 01:31.174
Help me serve the food I brought

15
01:31.257 --> 01:34.177
so our watch party will be more fun, right?

16
01:34.260 --> 01:35.595
Come on!

17
01:41.100 --> 01:42.060
Wait, you know what?

18
01:42.143 --> 01:44.562
I just remembered. I have a gift for Chiara.

19
01:44.646 --> 01:45.730
Wait here, okay?

20
01:47.774 --> 01:49.359
-Bro. -I'll leave this to you, okay?

21
01:49.442 --> 01:51.694
-I'll take care of it. -Thanks.

22
02:11.714 --> 02:12.882
Seems like before,

23
02:13.508 --> 02:16.469
I used to joke about walking you down the aisle.

24
02:17.595 --> 02:19.305
Chiara, I am so sure.

25
02:26.771 --> 02:29.190
-Are you sure? -Yes.

26
02:30.316 --> 02:31.693
Look at my face.

27
02:35.697 --> 02:36.990
Look at my face.

28
02:44.706 --> 02:45.915
Ouch!

29
02:46.583 --> 02:47.417
But now,

30
02:49.002 --> 02:50.295
it's almost here.

31
02:51.713 --> 02:53.214
Just a little longer,

32
02:53.298 --> 02:55.049
and it will finally come true.

33
02:58.928 --> 03:02.348
It's almost like fate was playing a joke when we first met.

34
03:04.058 --> 03:06.185
But we also proved, beyond a doubt,

35
03:06.269 --> 03:08.313
that we really are meant for each other.

36
03:11.065 --> 03:12.191
I'm listening.

37
03:17.864 --> 03:19.616
Chiara, I love you so much,

38
03:19.699 --> 03:21.409
so I accept you.

39
03:25.413 --> 03:29.500
I didn't want you to find out about this side of me.

40
03:30.126 --> 03:32.795
I was so scared you'd find out.

41
03:34.589 --> 03:37.550
I don't feel worthy of being loved.

42
03:44.515 --> 03:46.017
Chiara, never say that.

43
03:46.893 --> 03:48.603
We all deserve to love,

44
03:48.686 --> 03:50.188
especially you.

45
03:50.772 --> 03:53.191
But the truth is, there's only one thing I want.

46
03:53.274 --> 03:55.026
I just want to be with you.

47
03:58.571 --> 04:01.532
I can't wait to spend the rest of my life with you.

48
04:03.284 --> 04:07.038
You are truly a blessing in my life.

49
04:08.665 --> 04:12.460
I love you so, so, so much, Chiara.

50
04:17.131 --> 04:18.174
Mikoy.

51
04:29.894 --> 04:31.771
What could this be?

52
04:40.280 --> 04:41.572
So cute!

53
04:42.198 --> 04:44.200
There's a Chiara too!

54
04:51.541 --> 04:55.128
Sorry, guys, if I have to be a killjoy, okay?

55
04:55.211 --> 04:57.839
But we have a schedule that you need to follow.

56
04:58.423 --> 04:59.674
So,

57
05:01.342 --> 05:04.637
It's time to leave our bride

58
05:04.721 --> 05:06.723
for the finishing touches.

59
05:06.806 --> 05:08.683
So come on, let's go, go, go.

60
05:08.766 --> 05:10.643
Wait. Wait a second.

61
05:10.727 --> 05:13.271
Chiara, if you need anything, I'll just be in the next room, okay?

62
05:13.354 --> 05:15.398
Actually, can I ask you a favor?

63
05:15.481 --> 05:16.524
Sure. What is it?

64
05:16.607 --> 05:18.276
My gift for Mikoy.

65
05:18.359 --> 05:20.862
Okay, sure. I'll get it.

66
05:24.115 --> 05:25.992
Don't worry, I'll make sure he gets it.

67
05:28.828 --> 05:29.954
-See you. -See you!

68
05:30.038 --> 05:32.081
-Okay go ahead. -We have to go.

69
05:32.165 --> 05:32.999
Come on, come on.

70
05:35.626 --> 05:36.711
No, not like that.

71
05:36.794 --> 05:37.920
Where's the one doing the retouch?

72
05:40.798 --> 05:42.967
I want it perfect. You have to look good.

73
05:43.051 --> 05:44.594
Beautiful, flawless.

74
05:44.677 --> 05:45.928
Okay, there. That's it.

75
05:48.056 --> 05:49.140
Okay.

76
05:49.724 --> 05:52.226
On the count of three, come closer slowly and smile, okay?

77
05:56.606 --> 05:58.900
Sir, not much.

78
05:58.983 --> 05:59.817
Okay.

79
05:59.901 --> 06:02.403
Okay, one, two, three, look at me.

80
06:04.280 --> 06:05.531
-Mikoy, Mikoy. -A little more.

81
06:05.615 --> 06:08.409
He said don't show your teeth.

82
06:08.493 --> 06:09.452
Just like that.

83
06:10.912 --> 06:12.497
-There. -Okay, okay.

84
06:12.580 --> 06:13.956
-My goodness. -There.

85
06:14.040 --> 06:15.083
How do I do that?

86
06:17.418 --> 06:18.377
Like that.

87
06:18.461 --> 06:20.922
Like that, right?

88
06:21.005 --> 06:21.839
But, son,

89
06:21.923 --> 06:23.341
that's really part of it, okay?

90
06:23.424 --> 06:24.550
You have to own it.

91
06:24.634 --> 06:27.845
You have to feel like you're GGSS.

92
06:27.929 --> 06:29.388
-There! -GGSS!

93
06:29.472 --> 06:31.724
-Okay, okay, okay. -It's easy. Try it.

94
06:31.808 --> 06:33.142
Okay, try.

95
06:38.898 --> 06:40.483
Still not it.

96
06:41.484 --> 06:43.069
-One more, one more. -One more.

97
06:43.152 --> 06:45.822
-How are you supposed to smile, sir? -Relax.

98
06:45.905 --> 06:47.406
Just relax.

99
06:48.407 --> 06:50.159
-Let's just relax. -Okay.

100
06:51.035 --> 06:54.163
Mikoy, just relax.

101
06:54.247 --> 06:55.998
If you don't overthink your smile,

102
06:56.082 --> 06:58.334
your natural charm will come out even more.

103
06:59.627 --> 07:00.545
Right.

104
07:01.838 --> 07:03.131
Okay, okay, sure.

105
07:03.214 --> 07:04.757
-Again. -Okay.

106
07:04.841 --> 07:05.758
Look into the distance.

107
07:05.842 --> 07:08.261
Look at me, one, two, three.

108
07:13.599 --> 07:15.852
-There you go! -You got it!

109
07:16.644 --> 07:18.479
You're really good, Agent Alex!

110
07:18.980 --> 07:20.606
Agent is all we need.

111
07:20.690 --> 07:23.109
Oh, and Chiara asked me to give this to you.

112
07:23.192 --> 07:24.193
Her gift.

113
08:24.170 --> 08:29.926
That you're the kind of person I could never get tired of talking to,

114
08:30.009 --> 08:32.595
teasing, and drinking with.

115
09:07.964 --> 09:09.215
Ben!

116
09:10.383 --> 09:11.968
Looks like we're short on soft drinks.

117
09:12.552 --> 09:14.178
Go get some from the pantry, okay?

118
09:14.262 --> 09:15.346
Right.

119
09:15.429 --> 09:16.472
Yes, General.

120
09:22.520 --> 09:27.483
I went over your profiling report on the immediate community in Albay.

121
09:28.776 --> 09:31.070
It seems a little too ordinary.

122
09:31.153 --> 09:32.238
Nothing stands out.

123
09:33.197 --> 09:34.532
That's the tricky part.

124
09:35.825 --> 09:40.288
Sometimes something ordinary can also mean

125
09:41.080 --> 09:43.374
there's something too good to be true.

126
09:44.875 --> 09:47.253
Someone stood out to me.

127
09:47.336 --> 09:48.713
Really, sir?

128
09:48.796 --> 09:49.672
Who?

129
09:50.506 --> 09:52.049
That vlogger.

130
09:52.883 --> 09:54.343
Rahmboy.

131
09:54.927 --> 09:55.886
Rahmboy.

132
09:56.762 --> 09:57.805
That's the one.

133
10:04.312 --> 10:05.229
Ben!

134
10:06.856 --> 10:08.065
Where is he?

135
10:16.365 --> 10:17.658
Be careful.

136
10:17.742 --> 10:19.410
Especially around Agent Alex.

137
10:19.910 --> 10:22.997
Nothing changes in the plan. We're going through with it.

138
10:50.816 --> 10:51.776
Sofie!

139
10:54.070 --> 10:55.821
There you go, there you go.

140
10:55.905 --> 10:57.406
Just a second.

141
10:58.282 --> 10:59.367
Hey!

142
10:59.450 --> 11:00.701
-Oh, geez. -Wait, wait.

143
11:00.785 --> 11:02.578
I know you’re not talking to anyone.

144
11:09.293 --> 11:10.211
Sofie.

145
11:13.881 --> 11:15.007
Sofie.

146
11:15.091 --> 11:16.592
He passed out!

147
11:56.090 --> 11:57.508
Let me just confirm something.

148
11:57.591 --> 11:59.677
The one I sent you, that's Cocoy's car, right?

149
12:00.386 --> 12:01.512
Yes, it is.

150
12:01.595 --> 12:02.805
It's his,

151
12:02.888 --> 12:05.182
and it's confirmed that Cocoy isn't here.

152
12:05.975 --> 12:07.476
And Carlota isn't here either.

153
12:08.102 --> 12:11.230
That's why they weren't responding in the group chat earlier.

154
12:11.313 --> 12:13.899
I thought they were with the remote team this whole time,

155
12:13.983 --> 12:15.484
but it turns out they're with Team Albay.

156
12:17.069 --> 12:19.363
-What? They're both here? -Yes.

157
12:20.865 --> 12:22.867
Wait, guys, we have an update.

158
12:22.950 --> 12:24.869
Someone I know said

159
12:24.952 --> 12:28.080
someone broke Viktor out last night, there.

160
12:32.960 --> 12:34.795
Looks like she escaped too.

161
12:34.879 --> 12:36.964
What? What's happening?

162
12:37.047 --> 12:38.424
And who would break them out?

163
12:38.507 --> 12:40.134
Unless the Valtrovis are here.

164
12:50.311 --> 12:51.896
Angelito?

165
12:53.981 --> 12:55.316
Angelito.

166
12:57.693 --> 12:58.527
You're too slow.

167
12:58.611 --> 12:59.612
I'll do mouth-to-mouth. I'll do it.

168
13:00.196 --> 13:01.030
Hold that.

169
13:01.113 --> 13:02.323
Hold this. Hurry up.

170
13:02.406 --> 13:04.533
Move aside. Go on, do it. Go!

171
13:05.784 --> 13:06.577
Hey, what do you mean, you?

172
13:06.660 --> 13:08.496
I'm doing the mouth-to-mouth! Get out of there!

173
13:08.579 --> 13:10.372
-All of you, move! -Come on.

174
13:11.081 --> 13:12.291
Angelito.

175
13:13.292 --> 13:14.460
You're taking too long.

176
13:14.543 --> 13:16.003
Hurry! Come on, hurry!

177
13:16.086 --> 13:17.171
-You’re too slow! -So slow.

178
13:17.254 --> 13:19.173
Wait, wait, wait!

179
13:19.673 --> 13:20.591
It's my first time!

180
13:38.651 --> 13:39.902
Just leave them.

181
13:40.486 --> 13:41.946
They'll come back.

182
13:43.030 --> 13:44.406
Did I hear that right?

183
13:46.617 --> 13:49.078
General Norberto said so.

184
13:52.248 --> 13:56.252
I understand if you're surprised.

185
13:57.920 --> 13:59.505
It's more than just a surprise, sir.

186
14:00.172 --> 14:01.882
We're completely shook!

187
14:02.800 --> 14:03.634
Sir,

188
14:04.718 --> 14:07.388
it's a good thing the higher-ups agreed to this,

189
14:07.471 --> 14:10.933
because they know Viktor and his people are a high-profile case.

190
14:20.150 --> 14:25.698
I just thought that since Chiara killed La Morte Bianca,

191
14:26.907 --> 14:29.118
and we secured the bomb,

192
14:37.042 --> 14:39.169
for the two of them.

193
14:39.795 --> 14:40.963
I agree, sir.

194
14:41.714 --> 14:43.883
I'm sure Chiara must be very happy right now.

195
14:45.342 --> 14:48.512
Sir, didn't that favor you asked for come with a price, too?

196
14:48.596 --> 14:49.805
That's right, sir.

197
14:49.889 --> 14:52.391
The higher-ups might come after you.

198
15:04.778 --> 15:09.491
His sudden transfer of Viktor and Brusko to a highly secured prison,

199
15:09.575 --> 15:12.411
on top of the string of violence that happened inside.

200
15:12.494 --> 15:14.622
With what he did,

201
15:14.705 --> 15:18.125
it's very obvious that he has it out for Viktor.

202
15:19.084 --> 15:21.629
Exactly. You're absolutely right, sir.

203
15:22.671 --> 15:25.841
But knowing Senator Quintin's connections,

204
15:27.009 --> 15:29.386
sooner or later, you might get a memo about this.

205
15:38.020 --> 15:42.274
For now, just think of me as a boss who isn't a killjoy.

206
15:42.358 --> 15:45.694
And since I rarely ask the higher-ups for a favor,

207
15:53.744 --> 15:56.205
-One for the books, that's for sure! -Yes.

208
16:03.045 --> 16:04.380
More pizza!

209
16:23.190 --> 16:24.858
Hey, Sofie!

210
16:27.945 --> 16:29.738
Don't avoid me now.

211
16:30.447 --> 16:31.532
Me?

212
16:31.615 --> 16:33.659
Weren't you the one avoiding me all this time?

213
16:34.243 --> 16:36.203
How does it feel to be the one being avoided?

214
16:36.912 --> 16:38.205
Awkward, isn't it?

215
16:39.039 --> 16:41.458
How does it feel to be on the receiving end?

216
16:50.509 --> 16:53.429
Just because we got drunk the other day

217
16:54.471 --> 16:56.890
doesn't mean any of that wasn't real.

218
17:03.147 --> 17:04.023
Because

219
17:04.815 --> 17:06.275
the truth is,

220
17:09.445 --> 17:10.404
I like you.

221
17:26.420 --> 17:27.713
That's your answer? Okay?

222
17:28.964 --> 17:30.215
You're so nonchalant.

223
17:36.138 --> 17:38.474
Or we could go with "bebu."

224
17:40.017 --> 17:41.810
Then,

225
17:42.394 --> 17:43.228
love.

226
18:16.720 --> 18:18.639
The bride isn't done yet!

227
18:18.722 --> 18:20.724
She'll come out according to our schedule.

228
18:20.808 --> 18:21.975
Keep going.

229
18:23.602 --> 18:25.437
You're so persistent!

230
18:25.521 --> 18:27.147
She's really not done yet!

231
18:36.323 --> 18:38.909
I'm sorry, no offense, but it's important.

232
18:38.992 --> 18:41.370
There's a surprise for the bride.

233
19:23.704 --> 19:25.247
Senator, there's bad news.

234
19:26.165 --> 19:26.999
What is it?

235
19:27.624 --> 19:30.460
Viktor escaped, along with Donabel.

236
19:35.090 --> 19:36.550
How did that happen?

237
19:36.633 --> 19:37.509
When?

238
19:38.760 --> 19:39.803
Just last night.

239
19:41.430 --> 19:42.639
It was sudden.

240
19:42.723 --> 19:45.100
Looks like someone up top gave the go-ahead.

241
19:52.649 --> 19:55.569
Someone had the nerve to bypass me?

242
19:56.153 --> 19:58.906
And who are these annoying people?

243
20:07.664 --> 20:10.083
She's so beautiful, Viktor. Look at her.

244
20:15.756 --> 20:18.217
That's nothing. Look, I have another one.

245
20:41.823 --> 20:42.908
My child.

246
20:47.412 --> 20:50.707
Sorry, okay? This is all we could manage.

247
20:57.339 --> 20:59.424
Here's another one. Look.

248
21:01.843 --> 21:04.221
Sorry, but I was the one who picked all of these.

249
21:04.304 --> 21:05.222
Chiara.

250
21:11.853 --> 21:13.647
It all happened so suddenly, right?

251
21:13.730 --> 21:15.816
We didn't expect we'd be able to make it.

252
21:15.899 --> 21:17.943
-Exactly. -Your father and I are so happy.

253
21:28.829 --> 21:30.122
What an irony.

254
21:31.999 --> 21:35.419
Back when we were living the good life,

255
21:36.461 --> 21:40.340
we could easily get you anything you wanted.

256
21:41.008 --> 21:42.968
Everything was within reach.

257
21:50.183 --> 21:51.268
Yes, that's true.

258
21:51.351 --> 21:52.436
Remember, honey?

259
21:52.519 --> 21:53.729
Oh, my gosh.

260
21:54.313 --> 21:55.772
We used to shop like crazy!

261
21:56.398 --> 21:58.775
Right? You know that.

262
21:58.859 --> 22:01.069
You always knew how much our bill was.

263
22:01.153 --> 22:02.612
We really shopped like crazy.

264
22:02.696 --> 22:05.115
The shopping couldn't keep up with us.

265
22:07.868 --> 22:09.745
I remember this one time,

266
22:10.329 --> 22:15.542
we bought so much stuff, and then we just gave it all to the saleslady.

267
22:15.625 --> 22:17.461
And they were so shocked.

268
22:17.544 --> 22:19.338
Because they thought it was

269
22:19.963 --> 22:21.048
a prank.

270
22:21.131 --> 22:22.591
Like some social experiment.

271
22:23.675 --> 22:24.760
We just didn't know what to do with our money

272
22:24.843 --> 22:26.094
back then.

273
22:38.565 --> 22:40.150
But seriously.

274
22:51.078 --> 22:53.080
I really thought

275
22:53.163 --> 22:56.083
you wouldn't be able to make it to my wedding.

276
23:07.719 --> 23:08.553
You know,

277
23:09.096 --> 23:13.266
I'm really getting stressed out because of that GAGO.

278
23:13.892 --> 23:17.896
I'm so stressed, I need to schedule a session with my doctor.

279
23:18.772 --> 23:20.607
Your doctor already went abroad.

280
23:21.399 --> 23:22.734
When will they be back? No!

281
23:22.818 --> 23:25.195
Call them and tell them this is an urgent matter.

282
23:25.278 --> 23:26.488
Tell them to come home.

283
23:27.197 --> 23:29.157
Apparently, even your doctor

284
23:29.241 --> 23:32.244
is now being investigated by GAGO agents.

285
23:33.620 --> 23:35.163
Son of a…

286
23:36.248 --> 23:37.415
tofu!

287
23:38.917 --> 23:40.210
And apparently, you're

288
23:40.293 --> 23:42.003
next on their list to investigate.

289
23:47.384 --> 23:49.427
They won't find anything in their investigation.

290
23:53.223 --> 23:57.310
I have solid connections in different government departments!

291
23:57.394 --> 23:58.353
Let them try me.

292
24:00.939 --> 24:02.607
I'm just not going to let

293
24:02.691 --> 24:05.360
myself be the only one stressed out.

294
24:11.032 --> 24:13.785
I don't want them to be the only ones having fun.

295
24:25.463 --> 24:26.798
La Morte Bianca's Mama Yaya?

296
24:26.882 --> 24:29.509
Your nanny when you trained in Sicily?

297
24:38.310 --> 24:40.437
Love wears many faces.

298
24:40.520 --> 24:43.315
There are many ways to care

299
24:43.398 --> 24:45.609
and many ways to sacrifice.

300
24:45.692 --> 24:47.527
But we are always have to choose.

301
24:48.111 --> 24:49.946
There's always a decision to make.

302
24:50.030 --> 24:51.740
And until the very end,

303
24:51.823 --> 24:54.075
I will choose to love in the only way I know how.

304
24:54.743 --> 24:57.662
For the person I love most.

305
25:11.551 --> 25:14.304
MJ? What's the update?

306
25:14.387 --> 25:16.932
Why is it taking so long for the door to open?

307
25:17.015 --> 25:18.725
MJ. MJ!
